{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XbnEZmifA1lGF6sZcHX5Qw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:47.435872+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XbnEZmifA1lGF6sZcHX5Qw","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/btLkCxjz5dK8ISDATibPlsF3w8M7ic9kyAFuK3SYTFKd17sibgL6iaCNiaTicuZIticveK2xjRYgQficfW7QvpH8OFK0D6XQLO7mibiaibe9jGLOGVk1nQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>材料科学与工程学院2026年（第十六届）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>全国优秀大学生夏令营通知</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/btLkCxjz5dKQe4iabwaAR7v4a7wvv56gIghu8ssWDOMj5dicNQmiaHdlRficDHlDguepzxEAjkfVOOJlm5eQdYXtDpDuaO3h2dsa0RPic7ckU9mg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>为促进全国高校优秀大学生之间的交流、提高和加深青年学生对科学研究的兴趣和了解，西安交通大学材料科学与工程学院将于7月17日-19日在西安举办第十六届“相约古都，探索材料”全国优秀大学生夏令营。现面向全国各大高校招收营员，欢迎广大同学报名。具体事项通知如下：</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动时间和形式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>1. 活动时间：</span></strong><span>受其他全国性会议临时改期影响，本夏令营时间变更为2026年7月18日-19日（7月17日注册报到）。</span></p><p><strong><span>2. 活动形式：</span></strong><span>采用线下方式举办，校外营员160名左右，本校营员若干。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>2</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动内容</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>夏令营期间进行学院介绍、金属材料强度全国重点实验室介绍、前沿学术讲座、各系室介绍、参观实验室及优秀学子经验分享交流等活动。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>1. 材料及相关专业在校优秀本科生（2027年本科应届毕业生）；</span></p><p><span>2. 拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱祖国，诚实守信，无任何考试考核作弊、剽窃他人成果及其他违法违纪处分记录；</span></p><p><span>3. 身心健康，健康状况需符合教育部规定的研究生招考体检标准；</span></p><p><span>4. 符合下列条件之一：</span></p><p><span>（1）所在高校为“双一流”建设高校；</span></p><p><span>（2）所在学科为最新一轮学科评估中位列B+及以上；</span></p><p><span>（3）其余院校，学习成绩在专业排名前5%。</span></p><p><span>5. 对材料科学与工程有浓厚兴趣、有志于从事相关研究，并有较强或潜在的科研能力；</span></p><p><span>6. 英语水平要求：六级成绩≥425分或新TOEFL≥90分或IELTS≥6.0。</span></p><p><span>注：本科阶段获科研成果奖励或在国家级竞赛中获奖者，优先录取。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>1. 网上报名：</span></strong><span>6月8日-6月21日</span></p><p><strong><span>2. 注册填报：</span></strong></p><p><span>登陆西安交通大学夏令营硕士招生系统（http://yzbm.xjtu.edu.cn/），报名项目选择“全国优秀大学生夏令营”，注册获取报名号，用报名号重新登录，阅读查看学院夏令营相关规定，填写报名信息，上传材料后保存、提交，等待学院审核，可在报名页面查看报名审核通过与否、确认是否参加等。</span></p><p><strong><span>3. 上传材料</span></strong></p><p><span>（1）个人简历；</span></p><p><span>（2）身份证扫描件（正反面扫描到一页）；</span></p><p><span>（3）本科现阶段成绩单扫描件，需加盖学校或院系教务部门公章；</span></p><p><span>（4）相关证明材料扫描件，如大学英语六级、TOEFL/GRE、IELTS等英语考试成绩单，学术论文（首页）、专利等学术成果，课外学术科技活动获奖证书及其他相关证书。</span></p><p><span>在系统中提交的报名材料请按上述顺序彩色扫描拼接到一个PDF文档中（命名方式：申请编号-姓名-本科学校），并将该PDF文档压缩后上传，材料力求精简，总页数不超过20页，英语水平证明和其他获奖证书、证件建议采用缩印的形式，图文清晰即可。</span></p><p><span><strong><span>注：此次夏令营仅接收系统报名，无需邮寄纸质材料！</span></strong></span></p><p><strong><span>4.审核录取及学生确认</span></strong></p><p><span>第一批：学院将对网报信息进行审核、筛选，并于6月17日择优录取第一批次，报名系统显示审核通过的营员须于6月18日中午12:00前在报名端确认是否参加，逾期不确认者视为自动放弃。</span></p><p><span>第二批：6月21日报名结束后对第二批次进行审核、筛选，并于6月22日择优录取第二批次，报名系统显示审核通过的营员须于6月23日中午12:00前在报名端确认是否参加，逾期不确认者视为自动放弃。</span></p><p><span>届时入选营员名单将在材料学院官网公布，未入选者不再另行通知。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>5</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>1. 申报材料及相关信息必须真实，若有造假，一经查实，将被取消参营资格。</span></p><p><span>2. 学院对参加夏令营活动的学生提供食宿。</span></p><p><span>3. 被录取的营员原则上须全程参加夏令营活动。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>联系邮箱：</span></strong><span>clzhangxx@xjtu.edu.cn</span></p><p><strong><span>咨询电话：</span></strong><span>029-82665286</span></p><p><span>更多内容敬请关注西安交通大学材料学院官网。诚邀优秀大学生参加我院2026年夏令营活动！我们西安见！</span></p><p><span><strong><span>注：请确认参加夏令营的营员进QQ群（群号：683054516）</span></strong></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>材料科学与工程学院</span></p><p><span>2026年6月5日</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/srp6HPgmO0YtaICPMzcYxiaPu5c1icdPX8cDDAjMQXWvxmcBF7hdzms1kKmr6Q51wLfhf7ojGXUI5wHowvJ3qddw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>责编 | 宋京恩</span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"d57069d19ad869641f998f7c36c350e3a3630de5eb3a70111036b72198080951","textLength":1543,"sourceSha256":"148c114bfee296c6652b74b76d147142b4b39b309f567b9bac829113be12fb05","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d0cfc83e00e585a652b7","title":"2026年西安交通大学材料科学与工程学院2026年（第十六届）全国优秀大学生夏令营通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:47.435872+00:00"}
